{"id":"vihren","name":"Vihren","qid":"Q1140684","country":"Bulgaria","locality":"Bansko, Blagoevgrad","lat":"41.766388888","lon":"23.399444444","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"mountain; two-thousander; main peak; ultra-prominent peak","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vihren","text":"Vihren (Bulgarian: Вихрен [ˈvixrɛn]) is the highest peak of Bulgaria's Pirin Mountains. Reaching 2,914 metres (9,560 ft), it is Bulgaria's second and the Balkans' third highest, after Musala and Mount Olympus. Although Vihren is deprived of lakes and streams due to the karst topography, a number of Pirin's lakes are located around the peak, as is Europe's southernmost glacial mass, the Snezhnika glacieret.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vihren","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-19dec351aae3","w":1200,"h":434,"title":"Pirin - hiking trail from Vihren.jpg","o":"gh-19dec351aae3.jpg","credit":{"text":"Pudelek (Marcin Szala)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pirin_-_hiking_trail_from_Vihren.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}},{"id":"gh-30b447ad943d","w":1200,"h":741,"title":"Pirin - Vihren peak.JPG","o":"gh-30b447ad943d.jpg","credit":{"text":"Pudelek (Marcin Szala)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pirin_-_Vihren_peak.JPG","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}},{"id":"gh-44c540f3cfbb","w":1200,"h":495,"title":"BG-Pirin-Vihren.jpg","o":"gh-44c540f3cfbb.jpg","credit":{"text":"Unknown author","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BG-Pirin-Vihren.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--vihren","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Vihren","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p14d884574db","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p14d884574db.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vihren_in-game_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Jostriker on 2026-06-19"}}]}]}